{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-12-08 11:27:00', 'title': 'KROGER FULFILLMENT NETWORK EXPANDS WITH CUSTOMER FULFILLMENT CENTER IN NORTH CAROLINA', 'text': "RALEIGH, N.C., DEC. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S LARGEST GROCERY RETAILER, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL OFFER MORE AMERICANS\xa0DELIVERY THROUGH THE ADDITION OF A NEW CUSTOMER FULFILLMENT CENTER (CFC)\xa0IN\xa0NORTH CAROLINA, POWERED BY THE OCADO GROUP (LSE: OCDO) AND COMBINING VERTICAL INTEGRATION, MACHINE LEARNING, AND ROBOTICS TO PROVIDE AN AFFORDABLE, FRIENDLY, AND FAST FRESH FOOD DELIVERY SERVICE AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S SEAMLESS ECOSYSTEM."}